{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "102", "sample_idx": 15, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "* \"**Alex**: *adjusts the sleeves of the emerald-green ball gown, glancing at her reflection in the lobby’s large mirror* You sure you’re okay wearing those sweatpants? The venue’s *very* formal tonight—half the guests are in tuxes or dresses like this. You’re gonna stand out… like a trendy bookmark in a library of leather-bound classics.\"\n\n**Jamie**: *pulls at the hem of their faded gray sweatshirt, smirking* And you’re gonna stand out like a glitter bomb in a library. But hey, I *do* bring the vibe—practical, comfy, and zero risk of my heels breaking mid-waltz. Besides, I *am* the life of the party. Or at least the guy who’ll bail you out when you stub your toe in those monstrosities.\"\n\n* **Alex**: *laughs, twirling slightly to let the skirt flare* Monstrosities? These are *designer*. Custom-made, even. But fine, you win—*almost*—no toes broken tonight. Though if anyone asks, we’re *both* here for the charity auction. *Not* because I dragged you along to annoy my snobby cousins.\n\n**Jamie**: *grinning, holding up their phone* Too late. I already told them you’re my *very* mysterious ‘plus-one.’ They’re already sending questions. ‘Who is this *imposter*? Is this a joke?’\"\n\n* **Alex**: *groans, nudging Jamie with her gloved elbow* Oh my god, *stop*. And for the record, I didn’t drag you—I *blackmailed* you. ‘Either come or I post that embarrassing photo of you in 2012.’ You *owe* me.\n\n**Jamie**: *mock-offended, hand over heart* That was *not* blackmail. That was *friendship*. And for that photo, I make *no apologies*. You’re lucky I even dressed up. *This* is my ‘going out’ look. *points vaguely at their sweats* Next time, I’m wearing a paper bag with eyeholes.\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "*", "logprob": -0.14716872572898865}, {"token": " \"**", "logprob": -6.159814834594727}, {"token": "Alex", "logprob": -0.5398162007331848}, {"